1
00:00:52,720 --> 00:00:54,320
I know what you're going to say.

2
00:00:54,320 --> 00:00:56,200
You always say the same things.

3
00:00:56,280 --> 00:00:58,010
If you can't say it, just leave.

4
00:00:58,560 --> 00:01:00,160
Just consider it my charity.

5
00:01:10,760 --> 00:01:11,560
Thank you.

6
00:01:15,800 --> 00:01:17,720
I thought you'd say I was pitying you

7
00:01:17,720 --> 00:01:19,250
and shouldn't have helped.

8
00:01:22,240 --> 00:01:24,600
I said that before because I was insecure.

9
00:01:24,720 --> 00:01:25,960
I used high-sounding words

10
00:01:25,960 --> 00:01:28,000
to hide my pathetic pride.

11
00:01:29,880 --> 00:01:31,410
You're quite honest today.

12
00:01:31,520 --> 00:01:32,320
Do you have

13
00:01:32,840 --> 00:01:34,000
to be drunk

14
00:01:34,000 --> 00:01:35,880
to drop your stubbornness?

15
00:01:37,400 --> 00:01:38,400
Let's celebrate.

16
00:01:45,200 --> 00:01:46,729
From today on, you are free.

17
00:01:47,080 --> 00:01:48,520
Your mom promised me

18
00:01:48,680 --> 00:01:50,740
she won't come looking for you again.

19
00:01:56,240 --> 00:01:57,080
What,

20
00:01:57,880 --> 00:01:58,800
not happy?

21
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:00,720
No.

22
00:02:02,200 --> 00:02:03,240
You have to accept that

23
00:02:03,240 --> 00:02:04,080
in this world,

24
00:02:04,080 --> 00:02:06,810
there are parents
who don't love their children.

25
00:02:06,840 --> 00:02:07,960
If you can't change it,

26
00:02:07,960 --> 00:02:09,639
then think more about yourself.

27
00:02:09,639 --> 00:02:12,800
Your life is your own.

28
00:02:18,079 --> 00:02:18,880
I understand.

29
00:02:19,320 --> 00:02:20,640
I just never thought

30
00:02:20,640 --> 00:02:22,970
you'd be the one
to make this choice for me.

31
00:02:23,760 --> 00:02:25,820
I thought you would never forgive me.

32
00:02:28,640 --> 00:02:29,280
You always

33
00:02:29,280 --> 00:02:31,480
mix up these two things.

34
00:02:31,600 --> 00:02:33,400
But to me, they are two different matters.

35
00:02:33,400 --> 00:02:34,000
I just think

36
00:02:34,000 --> 00:02:35,520
it's not worth trapping a person

37
00:02:35,520 --> 00:02:36,600
for 100,000 yuan.

38
00:02:36,800 --> 00:02:37,660
Yue Shanchuan,

39
00:02:38,760 --> 00:02:41,360
this little money means nothing to me.

40
00:02:41,640 --> 00:02:44,000
Just take it as compensation
for messing with you back then.

41
00:02:44,000 --> 00:02:45,040
As for the IOU,

42
00:02:46,079 --> 00:02:46,940
just tear it up.

43
00:02:49,000 --> 00:02:50,460
I will definitely pay back

44
00:02:51,240 --> 00:02:53,280
this 100,000 yuan with interest.

45
00:02:54,040 --> 00:02:54,900
Suit yourself.

46
00:02:55,200 --> 00:02:56,000
Shu Rong,

47
00:02:57,840 --> 00:02:59,280
I still want to tell you,

48
00:02:59,920 --> 00:03:01,080
last time at the fireworks festival...

49
00:03:01,080 --> 00:03:01,760
I know.

50
00:03:02,720 --> 00:03:04,850
I actually heard everything that day.

51
00:03:09,720 --> 00:03:10,720
Then this time,

52
00:03:11,640 --> 00:03:13,500
let me walk into your world, okay?

53
00:03:17,440 --> 00:03:19,120
When I tried so hard
to walk toward you before,

54
00:03:19,120 --> 00:03:20,760
you wouldn't even take a single step.

55
00:03:20,760 --> 00:03:21,760
Now that I've turned away,

56
00:03:21,760 --> 00:03:22,880
you start chasing me.

57
00:03:22,880 --> 00:03:23,720
Sorry,

58
00:03:24,720 --> 00:03:26,600
but I never look back.

59
00:03:45,000 --> 00:03:47,040
Isn't it too late for Yue Shanchuan

60
00:03:47,040 --> 00:03:48,280
to realize this?

61
00:03:48,760 --> 00:03:49,520
Do you think

62
00:03:49,520 --> 00:03:51,520
they'll end up like in those novels,

63
00:03:51,920 --> 00:03:54,079
where he has to grovel to win her back?

64
00:03:55,720 --> 00:03:57,579
Yue Shanchuan missed his chance.

65
00:03:59,400 --> 00:04:00,320
I knew it.

66
00:04:00,320 --> 00:04:02,040
People should cherish the present.

67
00:04:02,040 --> 00:04:04,240
Don't wait until it's gone to regret it.

68
00:04:04,360 --> 00:04:06,320
We should indeed cherish the present.

69
00:04:06,320 --> 00:04:08,920
If you could just cherish me a little,

70
00:04:08,920 --> 00:04:10,980
I wouldn't be having such a hard time.

71
00:04:13,120 --> 00:04:14,000
What did I do?

72
00:04:14,160 --> 00:04:15,820
Why are you having a hard time?

73
00:04:17,120 --> 00:04:18,680
I'm waiting for your reply.

74
00:04:18,680 --> 00:04:20,140
It's been so hard waiting.

75
00:04:23,560 --> 00:04:25,360
How are you so good at playing dumb?

76
00:04:25,360 --> 00:04:28,160
I'm confessing my feelings to you.
Say something.

77
00:04:31,320 --> 00:04:33,000
Say something.

78
00:04:33,720 --> 00:04:35,360
I think this coffee is a bit weak.

79
00:04:35,360 --> 00:04:37,020
Let me add some coffee powder.

80
00:04:38,680 --> 00:04:41,740
You're not leaving today
until you answer my question.

81
00:04:44,320 --> 00:04:45,560
I...

82
00:04:53,560 --> 00:04:54,360
Qingqing!

83
00:04:58,760 --> 00:04:59,560
Mom!

84
00:05:02,400 --> 00:05:03,200
Sweetie!

85
00:05:13,360 --> 00:05:14,800
Why didn't you tell me

86
00:05:14,800 --> 00:05:16,360
you were bringing Zhang Yi?

87
00:05:16,760 --> 00:05:18,400
He was worried about you.

88
00:05:18,600 --> 00:05:19,920
You didn't even tell us

89
00:05:19,920 --> 00:05:21,560
when you got here.

90
00:05:21,680 --> 00:05:24,080
Is it hard being the store manager here?

91
00:05:24,200 --> 00:05:26,400
Look at you. You've lost weight.

92
00:05:26,760 --> 00:05:27,760
Lost weight?

93
00:05:28,040 --> 00:05:29,080
I eat nine meals a day.

94
00:05:29,080 --> 00:05:30,680
I've gained almost five jin.

95
00:05:31,080 --> 00:05:31,880
Come, sit.

96
00:05:34,200 --> 00:05:36,680
If Zhang hadn't called me,

97
00:05:36,680 --> 00:05:38,409
I wouldn't have known you quit.

98
00:05:39,720 --> 00:05:41,200
Your mom asked about you.

99
00:05:41,200 --> 00:05:42,440
I couldn't just pretend I didn't know.

100
00:05:42,440 --> 00:05:43,880
You're under a lot of stress at work.

101
00:05:43,880 --> 00:05:45,440
It's good to take a break.

102
00:05:45,440 --> 00:05:47,040
Then rest for a few more days,

103
00:05:47,040 --> 00:05:48,570
and we can leave after that.

104
00:05:49,520 --> 00:05:50,200
Leave?

105
00:05:51,240 --> 00:05:52,440
Leave for where?

106
00:05:52,920 --> 00:05:55,760
Qingqing, I found you a new job.

107
00:05:55,760 --> 00:05:58,200
It's an internal referral for a project
planner at a big tech company.

108
00:05:58,200 --> 00:06:00,120
You can start as soon as you get there.

109
00:06:00,120 --> 00:06:01,880
I've also got our marital home ready.

110
00:06:01,880 --> 00:06:03,600
As the lady of the house,

111
00:06:03,880 --> 00:06:06,440
you have the final say
on all the renovations.

112
00:06:06,600 --> 00:06:07,640
Your mom and I

113
00:06:07,640 --> 00:06:09,600
came here just to take you back.

114
00:06:09,600 --> 00:06:11,040
Let's talk about the engagement.

115
00:06:11,040 --> 00:06:12,440
We consulted a master.

116
00:06:12,640 --> 00:06:13,440
Next month is a good-- No.

117
00:06:13,440 --> 00:06:14,600
Wait, wait, wait.

118
00:06:16,400 --> 00:06:18,880
Zhang Yi, aren't we already over?

119
00:06:21,400 --> 00:06:22,280
Qingqing,

120
00:06:27,600 --> 00:06:29,200
I said those things in anger.

121
00:06:29,280 --> 00:06:30,160
I admit,

122
00:06:30,360 --> 00:06:31,760
I didn't control

123
00:06:31,760 --> 00:06:33,000
my emotions well before.

124
00:06:33,000 --> 00:06:34,060
I apologize to you.

125
00:06:34,159 --> 00:06:35,800
I've reflected a lot lately.

126
00:06:35,880 --> 00:06:36,600
I'm still willing

127
00:06:36,600 --> 00:06:38,560
to make sacrifices and changes for you.

128
00:06:38,560 --> 00:06:40,120
I've also discussed it with my family.

129
00:06:40,120 --> 00:06:41,800
Nothing that makes you unhappy

130
00:06:41,800 --> 00:06:43,130
will ever happen again.

131
00:06:43,280 --> 00:06:45,760
I hope we can go back to the way we were.

132
00:06:46,840 --> 00:06:47,680
Qingqing,

133
00:06:48,120 --> 00:06:49,960
I've seen

134
00:06:50,240 --> 00:06:52,000
how hard Zhang has been working for you.

135
00:06:52,000 --> 00:06:52,800
Besides,

136
00:06:52,800 --> 00:06:55,659
it's normal for young people
to have little fights.

137
00:06:55,880 --> 00:06:58,159
Your dad and I
went through the same thing.

138
00:06:58,159 --> 00:06:59,200
I just want

139
00:06:59,840 --> 00:07:02,600
someone who loves you
to protect you by your side.

140
00:07:02,680 --> 00:07:04,280
And I want you to settle down soon.

141
00:07:04,280 --> 00:07:07,600
Yes, I also hope to marry you soon.

142
00:07:10,800 --> 00:07:13,840
Mom, go back to your room
and rest for a bit.

143
00:07:15,200 --> 00:07:16,000
Okay.

144
00:07:17,240 --> 00:07:18,640
Have a good talk, okay?

145
00:07:26,720 --> 00:07:28,120
Come with me for a second.

146
00:07:35,240 --> 00:07:37,320
Zhang Yi, what do you mean?

147
00:07:37,600 --> 00:07:39,130
Using my mom to pressure me?

148
00:07:39,320 --> 00:07:40,760
I'm here to pick you up.

149
00:07:41,320 --> 00:07:42,980
Your mom wanted to see you too.

150
00:07:43,040 --> 00:07:44,240
It was just on the way.

151
00:07:44,360 --> 00:07:46,480
I remember when you asked for a breakup,

152
00:07:46,480 --> 00:07:48,159
I agreed to it pretty quickly, didn't I?

153
00:07:48,159 --> 00:07:49,400
We are all adults.

154
00:07:49,640 --> 00:07:51,920
Let's not pester each other
after breaking up.

155
00:07:51,920 --> 00:07:53,520
You're just saying that
out of anger again.

156
00:07:53,520 --> 00:07:56,640
You know my parents
never approved back then.

157
00:07:57,080 --> 00:07:58,320
I was under pressure too.

158
00:07:58,320 --> 00:07:59,680
But I've overcome all that now.

159
00:07:59,680 --> 00:08:00,400
Overcome?

160
00:08:03,120 --> 00:08:04,360
How did you overcome it?

161
00:08:04,360 --> 00:08:06,680
Did you lie to them
that I have depression,

162
00:08:06,680 --> 00:08:07,880
that I'm madly in love with you,

163
00:08:07,880 --> 00:08:09,520
and that if I can't be with you,

164
00:08:09,520 --> 00:08:10,360
I'd rather die?

165
00:08:10,360 --> 00:08:12,490
That I'd hang myself or slit my wrists?

166
00:08:14,960 --> 00:08:17,400
Zhang Yi, I'm really tired.

167
00:08:18,640 --> 00:08:20,840
Let me go, and let yourself go too.

168
00:08:21,200 --> 00:08:23,320
Look at you, throwing a tantrum again.

169
00:08:23,320 --> 00:08:24,400
With your temper,

170
00:08:24,520 --> 00:08:26,440
who else but me could stand you?

171
00:08:27,000 --> 00:08:28,520
Come here, give me a hug.

172
00:08:28,520 --> 00:08:30,120
A hug will make it all better.

173
00:08:31,240 --> 00:08:33,320
I'm officially informing you right now.

174
00:08:33,320 --> 00:08:35,400
Zhang Yi, we are truly over.

175
00:08:35,480 --> 00:08:37,200
Not just because of my job,

176
00:08:37,200 --> 00:08:39,059
nor just because of your parents,

177
00:08:39,960 --> 00:08:41,080
but because

178
00:08:41,080 --> 00:08:42,520
there is absolutely no love
between us anymore.

179
00:08:42,520 --> 00:08:43,580
Do you understand?

180
00:08:47,600 --> 00:08:48,600
I don't like you.

181
00:08:49,920 --> 00:08:51,280
And you don't love me at all.

182
00:08:51,280 --> 00:08:52,800
How do I not love you?

183
00:08:52,840 --> 00:08:54,240
I've done so much for you.

184
00:08:54,600 --> 00:08:56,040
I just want to marry you.

185
00:08:59,680 --> 00:09:01,080
I know you're angry.

186
00:09:01,280 --> 00:09:02,760
Here, hit me.

187
00:09:02,760 --> 00:09:03,400
Hit me, okay?

188
00:09:03,400 --> 00:09:04,200
Don't do this.

189
00:09:04,200 --> 00:09:05,520
Stop being angry, okay?

190
00:09:05,520 --> 00:09:06,840
Let me go. Stop being angry.

191
00:09:06,840 --> 00:09:07,880
Let me go. Let go.

192
00:09:07,880 --> 00:09:08,440
Let go.

193
00:09:09,240 --> 00:09:10,680
Can't you see she doesn't want to?

194
00:09:10,680 --> 00:09:11,920
This is my girlfriend.

195
00:09:11,920 --> 00:09:12,720
Ex-

196
00:09:13,880 --> 00:09:14,680
girlfriend.

197
00:09:16,840 --> 00:09:18,900
So you're Qingqing's ex-boyfriend.

198
00:09:19,080 --> 00:09:21,440
Hello, I'm her next boyfriend.

199
00:09:22,560 --> 00:09:23,600
You're Shen Feng.

200
00:09:24,800 --> 00:09:26,520
You recognized me, junior.

201
00:09:27,920 --> 00:09:29,560
The genius of the math world.

202
00:09:29,800 --> 00:09:31,440
I wondered how far you'd go.

203
00:09:31,760 --> 00:09:34,560
Didn't expect you to end up
as a tea farmer here.

204
00:09:36,000 --> 00:09:37,160
What's wrong with being a tea farmer?

205
00:09:37,160 --> 00:09:38,680
Better than you being a thief.

206
00:09:38,680 --> 00:09:39,560
What thief?

207
00:09:39,840 --> 00:09:41,370
What are you talking about?

208
00:09:42,360 --> 00:09:44,000
You. A thief.

209
00:09:56,800 --> 00:09:59,080
Who made you my next boyfriend?

210
00:10:00,160 --> 00:10:01,600
Who else could it be?

211
00:10:08,800 --> 00:10:09,330
Let's go.

212
00:10:16,680 --> 00:10:17,880
Don't want to go back?

213
00:10:21,240 --> 00:10:23,520
Actually, I really miss my mom.

214
00:10:24,680 --> 00:10:25,800
But she came here

215
00:10:26,040 --> 00:10:28,560
just to make me go back with Zhang Yi.

216
00:10:28,760 --> 00:10:31,290
Zhang Yi and I have been dating
since college.

217
00:10:31,360 --> 00:10:32,800
She's seen our ups and downs

218
00:10:32,800 --> 00:10:34,080
over the years

219
00:10:35,040 --> 00:10:37,040
and knows it hasn't been easy for us.

220
00:10:37,640 --> 00:10:40,080
What do you think?

221
00:10:42,760 --> 00:10:43,600
I...

222
00:10:44,480 --> 00:10:45,610
Friendly reminder,

223
00:10:45,840 --> 00:10:48,700
sunk costs shouldn't factor
into major decisions.

224
00:10:49,960 --> 00:10:52,000
I... Who asked you?

225
00:11:03,160 --> 00:11:04,680
I don't want to wait anymore.

226
00:11:04,680 --> 00:11:05,560
Your mom is just

227
00:11:05,560 --> 00:11:07,440
blinded by Zhang Yi's facade right now.

228
00:11:07,440 --> 00:11:08,480
She needs to know

229
00:11:08,760 --> 00:11:10,840
her daughter deserves someone better.

230
00:11:10,840 --> 00:11:11,960
Someone better?

231
00:11:12,400 --> 00:11:13,200
Like who?

232
00:11:13,200 --> 00:11:14,000
Where?

233
00:11:14,160 --> 00:11:15,220
I don't see anyone.

234
00:11:15,920 --> 00:11:16,560
Who?

235
00:11:17,200 --> 00:11:17,960
Where is it?

236
00:11:21,960 --> 00:11:23,160
Right in front of you.

237
00:11:26,520 --> 00:11:27,920
You're so narcissistic.

238
00:11:27,960 --> 00:11:29,560
What's the use of being narcissistic?

239
00:11:29,560 --> 00:11:31,420
I want to be loved by you too, okay?

240
00:11:32,080 --> 00:11:32,880
Okay.

241
00:11:36,640 --> 00:11:38,900
These baby greens are so crisp and green.

242
00:11:39,080 --> 00:11:40,480
You can't buy anything this fresh

243
00:11:40,480 --> 00:11:42,400
at the market back home.

244
00:11:42,640 --> 00:11:43,240
These were grown

245
00:11:43,240 --> 00:11:44,960
by an old lady down the mountain.

246
00:11:44,960 --> 00:11:47,890
I had to go to her yard early
in the morning to buy them.

247
00:11:51,400 --> 00:11:53,080
You chop vegetables so neatly.

248
00:11:53,080 --> 00:11:55,000
Do you cook often at home?

249
00:11:55,200 --> 00:11:56,240
I have a younger brother.

250
00:11:56,240 --> 00:11:58,280
I still have to serve him
three meals a day.

251
00:11:58,280 --> 00:11:58,800
No wonder.

252
00:11:58,800 --> 00:12:01,730
What is the Snail Fairy doing
so early in the morning?

253
00:12:33,880 --> 00:12:34,520
This is

254
00:12:34,880 --> 00:12:37,080
yam and egg yolk porridge for Qingqing.

255
00:12:37,720 --> 00:12:39,160
She's been staying up too late lately.

256
00:12:39,160 --> 00:12:40,620
This is good for her sleep.

257
00:12:46,680 --> 00:12:47,480
You're awake.

258
00:12:52,920 --> 00:12:54,400
What are you guys making so early?

259
00:12:54,400 --> 00:12:55,960
It smells so good. I could smell it.

260
00:12:55,960 --> 00:12:57,620
We're making delicious food.

261
00:12:58,600 --> 00:13:00,280
Is there nothing I can help with?

262
00:13:00,280 --> 00:13:00,760
Go on.

263
00:13:01,120 --> 00:13:01,920
Go on.

264
00:13:06,120 --> 00:13:07,240
Quite a feast.

265
00:13:08,680 --> 00:13:09,760
Here you go, Auntie.

266
00:13:09,760 --> 00:13:10,560
Thank you.

267
00:13:11,440 --> 00:13:13,800
Feng, come sit next to me.

268
00:13:13,880 --> 00:13:14,740
Come over here.

269
00:13:22,240 --> 00:13:23,770
Come on, eat while it's hot.

270
00:13:24,240 --> 00:13:25,040
Wait a minute.

271
00:13:25,160 --> 00:13:26,640
Go call Zhang down.
